      "description": "With Whipp, no more 6pm \"what's for dinner?\"\nWe sort your meals for the whole week, all in less than a minute\n\nTell Whipp your budget and what you're into, and it plans the week and hands you the grocery list with the total already worked out. No third trip back for the one thing you forgot\n\nFEATURES\n•⁠ Smart and personalized meal planner for full week of dinners. Built around your budget, your store and what you actually like\n•⁠  ⁠Set your weekly budget cap, keep every plan under it\n•⁠  ⁠Your grocery list, grouped by aisle, with prices and an estimated total\n•⁠  ⁠Tick your items off as you shop and keep everything on track\n•⁠  ⁠Swap or redo any meal, and even the entire plan instantly\n•⁠  ⁠Hundreds of dinners: high protein, quick, comforting, and more\n•⁠  ⁠Pick what you're into and every week is built around your priorities\n•⁠  ⁠Set diets and allergies like vegetarian, vegan, pescatarian and more\n•⁠  ⁠Plans around your kitchen appliances\n•⁠  ⁠Calories and macros on every plate, with clear step-by-step recipes\n•⁠  ⁠Scale any recipe to how many you're cooking for\n•⁠  ⁠Save your favorites and revisit any past week's plan\n•⁠  ⁠Plan ahead for next week and beyond\n•⁠  ⁠Works with the big grocery stores in the US and UK\n\nHOW DOES IT WORK?\nWhipp is free to download and try, with premium features.\nThe premium version allows you to:\n1.⁠ ⁠Plan unlimited weeks: this one, the next one, and as far ahead as you like\n2.⁠ ⁠Set a weekly budget cap and see the total before you shop\n3.⁠ ⁠Swap and redo meals as much as you want\n4.⁠ ⁠Unlock the full recipe library, with calories and macros on every plate\n5.⁠ ⁠Fine-tune every week around your diet, allergies and the foods you can't stand\n6.⁠ ⁠Get plans built around your appliances, and save your favorites\n\nYou can start a 3-day free trial to access these premium features. Unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the free trial, you will be automatically charged the price shown at sign-up for your chosen subscription period. Your Whipp Premium subscription renews automatically at the end of each period (monthly or yearly) until you cancel. Canceling your subscription disables the automatic renewal. You'll keep access to premium features for the remainder of your then-current period. Note that deleting the app does not cancel your subscription.\n\nTerms: https://whipp.app/terms\nPrivacy: https://whipp.app/privacy",
